# prefix-block-col0-comment-inside

## Input

```
server.
  host localhost
# a comment at column 0 does not close the block
  port 8080

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..86
  PREFIX_BLOCK@0..86
    WORD_KEY@0..7
      WORD@0..7 "server."
    NEWLINE@7..8 "\n"
    SPACE@8..10 "  "
    ENTRY@10..25
      WORD_KEY@10..14
        WORD@10..14 "host"
      SPACE@14..15 " "
      LINE_STRING@15..24
        STRING@15..24 "localhost"
      NEWLINE@24..25 "\n"
    COMMENT@25..73 "# a comment at column ..."
    NEWLINE@73..74 "\n"
    SPACE@74..76 "  "
    ENTRY@76..86
      WORD_KEY@76..80
        WORD@76..80 "port"
      SPACE@80..81 " "
      INTEGER@81..85
        NUMERAL@81..85 "8080"
      NEWLINE@85..86 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        PrefixBlock {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..7 "server.",
            },
            items: [
                Entry {
                    key: WordKey {
                        word: WORD@10..14 "host",
                    },
                    value: LineString {
                        string: STRING@15..24 "localhost",
                    },
                },
                Entry {
                    key: WordKey {
                        word: WORD@76..80 "port",
                    },
                    value: Integer {
                        sign: none,
                        numeral: NUMERAL@81..85 "8080",
                    },
                },
            ],
        },
    ],
}
```

